--
-- When Event Starts:
-- - Zone Depops
-- - Extra Dwarf Defenders spawn to guard TODO: make these dwarves 
--   Player controalable.
-- - 13 waves of mobs will spawn in succession; each wave will have 
--   a wave master (Captain, General, Warlord) when the wave master 
